QuestGuidance.Register("en",384,{
[12257]="700572F7\n1\tInspect the illusion of the fourth stone\tThe missing stone is out there somewhere, waiting to be found.\n2\tFind the fourth stone\tThe missing stone is out there somewhere, waiting to be found.\n3\tFind the fourth stone\tThe missing stone is out there somewhere, waiting to be found.\n4\tInvestigate the chamber\tYou have found a hidden chamber in the Paths of the Dead. You should investigate the chamber.\n5\tInvestigate the chamber\tYou have found a hidden chamber in the White Mountains. You should investigate the chamber.\n6\tFind someone to help you remove the rune-stone\tA rune-stone trap stands in your way of the fourth stone. You should find someone who may be able to help.\n7\tFind the original chisel\tMárus has told you that you must find the original chisel to have any hopes of dismantling the rune-stone trap. You should find the original chisel.\n8\tGive Márus the required items\tMárus has asked you for several ingredients to make a protective rune-stone. His list included these items: powerful fire-enchanted chisel, copper and obsidian rune-stone base, polished dwarrowgleam.\n9\tRemove the rune-stone trap\tWith the protection rune-stone and the original chisel, you can now dismantle the trap. You should return the chamber in the Paths of the Dead and remove the rune-stone trap.\n10\tOpen the door\tWith the rune-stone removed, you can now safely open the door. You should open the door in the chamber.\n11\tTake the fourth stone\tThe fourth stone is yours for the taking! You should take the fourth stone.\n12\tReturn the stone to its pedestal\tThe fourth stone is yours! You should return it to its rightful place in the Crown Chamber.\n",
[12258]="70019A9A\n1\tDeliver the letter to a Town Crier\tDeliver the letter to a town crier and listen to what they have to say about the concerned farmer. You received a letter from a concerned farmer.\n2\tSpeak again with the Town Crier\tTown criers warn against it, but they do have a task that can be performed for a concerned farmer.\n",
[12259]="7006AAFB\n1\tDeliver the letter to a Town Crier\tDeliver the letter to a town crier and listen to what they have to say about the concerned farmer. You received a letter from a concerned farmer.\n2\tSpeak again with the Town Crier\tTown criers warn against it, but they do have a task that can be performed for a concerned farmer.\n",
[12260]="700173D9\n1\tTalk to Falgir at the Deep Descent\030Collect Crystal Fragment\tFalgir is at the Deep Descent. You should bring the crystal you found to a dwarf who might know of such things.\n",
[12261]="70002D04\n1\tArzhur is in Aughaire, north-east of Chief Crannog. Chief Crannog has sent you to speak to the Lore-singer Arzhur to hear about the history of his clan.\t\n",
[12262]="700683CD\n1\tCollect lizard frills ([see journal]/14)\tForay into the desert and obtain lizard frills from the reptiles there. You will need to travel north from the expedition camp. Once harvested, return the frills to Khânai at the encampment.\n2\tForay into the desert and obtain lizard frills from the reptiles there. You will need to travel north from the expedition camp. Once harvested, return the frills to Khânai at the encampment.\t\n",
[12263]="70058742\n1\tDefeat the Frost-horde upon the battlefield (total: 12)\tThe Frost-horde can be found upon the battlefield. You should defeat any of the Frost-horde you find upon the battlefield.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many of the Frost-horde upon the battlefield.\n",
[12264]="7005874D\n1\tDefeat the Frost-horde upon the battlefield (total: 15)\tThe Frost-horde can be found upon the battlefield. You should defeat any of the Frost-horde you find upon the battlefield.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many of the Frost-horde upon the battlefield.\n",
[12265]="7005AAF9\n1\tDefeat drakes in Uzdarulzahar (total: 7)\tThe Battle of Uzdarulzahar has begun! You should defeat drakes in Uzdarulzahar.\n2\tCompleted\tThe Battle of Uzdarulzahar proceeds!\n",
[12266]="7002519F\n1\tAttend a performance in the Frostbluff Theatre\tAttend a performance in the Frostbluff Theatre.\n2\tTalk to the Announcer\tSpeak with the hobbit outside the Frostbluff Theatre in Winter-home. You should tell the hobbit about the performance you saw.\n",
[12267]="700251A0\n1\tAttend a performance in the Frostbluff Theatre\tAttend a performance in the Frostbluff Theatre.\n2\tTalk to the Announcer\tSpeak with the hobbit outside the Frostbluff Theatre in Winter-home. You should tell the hobbit about the performance you saw.\n",
[12268]="7000EA9D\n1\tDestroy Gauradan territory markers (total: 6)\tThe Gauradan wards run in a line north of the Guaredain encampment Barad Gaurhoth, near Zigilgund. These wards are far across the bay to the south-west of Sûri-kylä. Vämmä has asked you to make a symbolic attack upon the wards that define the borders of the Gauredain's homeland.\n2\tSpeak with Vämmä at Sûri-kylä\tTell Vämmä that the Guaradan territory markers have been destroyed. He can be found at Sûri-kylä.\n",
[12269]="70068B6B\n1\tZuhûr asked you to speak with merchants at the Waterway Market and find out if anyone has any apricots for her to purchase.\t\n2\tTalk to Zuhûr at the Waterway Market\tZuhûr is at the Waterway Market, looking for apricots.\n3\tFind someone at the Dawn Market who will sell you apricots for Zuhûr\tThe Dawn Market is located east of the city walls.\n4\tBring her apricots to Zuhûr in the Lower Ward\tZuhûr is on a bench by the Waterway Market in the Lower Ward.\n",
[12270]="70034C19\n1\tGo to the funeral with Cyneberg\tCyneberg is keeping close to Gárwig in Lornsettle, the mead hall of Forlaw. Funeral preparations are being made and the townspeople are getting ready to gather at the graveyard.\n2\tSpeak with Cyneberg\tCyneberg is back in Thrymm's home near the southern gate of Forlaw. Thrymm and the others are now buried, and the time has come for the people of Forlaw to try to move on from their passing.\n",
[12271]="70016749\n1\tDefeat Zarza\tThe Globsnaga leader can be found at Dalgum-ru, south of the Shadowed Refuge. Tyki wants you to find the Orc-leader at Dalgum-ru and put an end to his offending existence.\n2\tSpeak to Tyki at the Shadowed Refuge\tTyki is at the Shadowed Refuge, north of Dalgum-ru. You should return to Tyki to tell him of the death of Zarza, the Orc-leader.\n",
[12272]="70017536\n1\tReturn to Glorelloth in the Shadowed Refuge\030Collect chunks of noxious fungus (total: 8)\tThe fungus of which Glorelloth spoke is to the north-east of the Sixteenth Hall. Glorelloth wishes you to collect fungus so that she may get a closer look at it and determine its nature.\n",
[12273]="70072716\n1\tCheck this stage in the quest journal.\t\n2\tEarn Mûr Ghala commendations by completing World Quests (total: 30)\tThroughout the broken realm, your efforts kindle a flicker of hope. In recognition of such valour, you will receive honours and rewards worthy of your pursuits.\n3\tCompleted\tThroughout the broken realm, your efforts kindle a flicker of hope. In recognition of such valour, you are granted honours and rewards worthy of your pursuits.\n",
[12274]="70049424\n1\tEnter Fushaum Bal\tFushaum Bal is located in Talath Úrui. You should establish contact with those in command of Fushaum Bal.\n2\tFind a suitable place to listen in southern Fushaum Bal\030Find a suitable place to listen in Fushaum Bal\030Find a suitable place to listen in northern Fushaum Bal\030Defeat an enemy in Fushaum Bal north to get attention\030Defeat an enemy in Fushaum Bal south to get attention\tFushaum Bal is located in Talath Úrui. You should find out who is in charge of these groups of men.\n3\tTalk to Thâng\030Talk to Mâlatuk\030Talk to Khirgi\tFushaum Bal is located in Talath Úrui. You should establish contact with those in command of Fushaum Bal.\n",
[12275]="70049425\n1\tReach a Neutral standing with Fushaum Bal South\030Reach a Neutral standing with Fushaum Bal North\tIn order to turn the various factions in Fushaum Bal against each other, you will need to earn their favour first.\n2\tReach an Enemy standing with Fushaum Bal South\030Reach an Enemy standing with Fushaum Bal North\tIn order to turn the various factions in Fushaum Bal against each other, you will need to disrupt both their efforts.\n3\tTalk to Thâng or Khirgi\tYou should talk to Thâng or Khirgi.\n4\tTalk to Thurindol\tThurindol can be found on the border of Talath Úrui and Dor Amarth. You should speak with Thurindol.\n",
[12276]="7005AB06\n1\tClimb the Father's Path and meet up with Hórin by the steps leading to the ruins of Uzdarulzahar\tHórin has gathered the dwarf reinforcements and is waiting for you at the stairs to the ruins of Uzdarulzahar. You should meet Hórin and complete 'Instance: The Warlord's Gambit'.\n2\tTalk to Hórin at Uzdarulzahar\tHórin is waiting for you at the gate of Uzdarulzahar. You should talk to Hórin.\n3\tComplete 'Hobgoblins at the Highest House' for Hórin\030Complete 'Dwarves in Arms' for Hórin\030Find and assist Dréri with his opponent\030Find and assist Náth with his opponent\030Find and assist Klúso with his opponent\030Find and assist Kyrstig with her opponent\030Find and assist Molkha with her opponent\tThe Battle of Uzdarulzahar has begun! You should complete objectives in Uzdarulzahar and find and assist your dwarf allies.\n4\tAssist Hórin by defeating Hárkyrta the Frigid\030(Optional) Use the battle horn to summon the scout trio\tHórin needs your assistance defeating Hárkyrta the Frigid in Uzdarulzahar. This will be a difficult fight! Use the battle horn at the gate of Uzdarulzahar to summon the scout trio if they have left your side.\n5\tTalk to Hórin at Uzdarulzahar\tThe drake has been slain! You should talk to Hórin. Use the battle horn at the gate of Uzdarulzahar to summon the scout trio if they have left your side.\n6\tTalk to Hórin in Fellgát\030(Optional) Talk to Hórin at Uzdarulzahar to quickly travel to Fellgát\tThe battle has been won! You should return to Fellgát and talk to Hórin.\n",
[12277]="7005CCA4\n1\tPick up the map of Clovengap\tThe map is on a table beside Gerja in Bazanmanar. You should pick up the map.\n2\tDeliver the map to Thyfli\tThyfli is in a small camp north of Bazanmanar. Gerja has asked you to bring a copy of the completed map to Thyfli.\n",
[12278]="70020A59\n1\tTalk to Maengamiel at the garden in Duillond\tMaengamiel in the Festival Garden at Duillond, near the Festival Area there. You should speak with Maengamiel for your introduction to the spring events taking place in Ered Luin this year.\n",
[12279]="7002FDA5\n1\tCatch Garsfeld guppies (total: 4)\tGarsfeld guppies can be found in the river just north of Garsfeld. The fish is elusive though and rarely stays in the same location for very long. Héalac asked you to catch several Garsfeld guppies.\n2\tBring the Garsfeld guppies to Héalac\tHéalac is at Snowbourn. Héalac will be eager to begin de-boning the Garsfeld guppies you caught.\n",
[12280]="7002885D\n1\tTalk to Dagoras to accompany Grimbold's emissary\tDagoras is at his camp near Isengard. Dagoras asked you to accompany the Grimbold's emissary to the gates of Isengard. You should speak with Dagoras when you are ready to meet the emissary.\n2\tTalk to Dagoras at his camp near Isengard\tDagoras is at his camp near Isengard. You should tell Dagoras what transpired at the meeting between Ordwaer and Saruman before the gates of Isengard.\n",
[12281]="7004955D\n1\tEnter Orodir\tOrodir is located next to Naerband. You should enter the encampment.\n2\tComplete Breaking the Chains\030Complete Freeing the Nurnhoth\030Complete For the Oppressed\030Defeat Ghâsh-hai Gate-wardens (total: 2)\tOrodir is located next to Naerband. You should complete quests within this encampment.\n3\tTalk to Akhrûn\tAkhrûn can be found just outside of Orodir, next to Naerband. You should speak with Akhrûn.\n",
[12282]="7006AFDA\n1\tTravel with Rothog to the audience\tSpeak to Rothog about the audience.\n2\tTalk to Rothog\tRothog has requested your presence for a petition of one of his nobles.\n3\tTalk to Rothog in Dâr Laja\tFollowing the audience, Rothog would like a word regarding the petition.\n",
[12283]="7006B05A\n1\tTalk to Rothog\tSpeak to Rothog regarding the petition from Zarzíra Dawn-star.\n2\tTalk to Rothog\tRothog has asked that you travel to within Dahâl Huliz, inside the the gladiator residences and speak to Shaidal about the situation.\n3\tTalk to Rothog in Dâr Laja\tAfter your conversation with Shaidal and the surprising ambush, speak to Rothog regarding the encounter.\n",
[12284]="7006B06A\n1\tLocate Makhil's passage near Hulzidâr\tSearch Hulzidâr, a small encampment beneath the arena, for Makhil's path.\n2\tLocate Makhil's passage west of Hulzidâr\tContinue your search for Makhil's path, west of Hulzidâr.\n3\tLocate Makhil's passage north of the cross-roads\tContinue your search for Makhil's path, north of the cross-roads, west of Hulzidâr.\n4\tLocate Makhil's passage near Kên Taghlim\tContinue your search for Makhil's path, near Kên Taghlim in Kamrabezûr.\n5\tTalk to Makhil east of Kên Taghlim\tSpeak to Makhil's about the information that he recovered from Zarzíra Dawn-star's estate.\n",
[12285]="7006B06C\n1\tLocate parcels in Ghâr Mejet (total: 6)\tMakhil has requested that you recover a series of evidence parcels hidden throughout Ghâr Mejet, an ancient crypt teeming with Wights in Kamrabezûr.\n2\tReturn to Dâr Laja and speak to Shaidal\tReturn to Dâr Laja and speak to Shaidal about the evidence that you recovered.\n",
[12286]="7006B072\n1\tTravel with Rothog to the audience chamber\tRothog the Storm asks you to approach with your findings.\n2\tTalk to Rothog\tRothog has requested that you present the evidence that you have gathered regarding Shaidal's actions.\n3\tTalk to Rothog in Dâr Laja\tFollowing the audience, Rothog would like a word.\n",
[12287]="7006B074\n1\tCollect metal chains (total: 8)\030Defeat gladiators (total: 16)\030Gather Rothog's food stuffs (total: 5)\tRothog the Storm has requested that travel into the catacombs to Harkhaphâr and do several tasks. He requests that you thin the number of gladiators there, gather their metal chains, and recover food stuffs from the camp.\n2\tRothog awaits you in the Dâr Laja Meeting Hall\tRothog awaits you in the Dâr Laja Meeting Hall. Return with the stolen objects and inform him of your victory.\n",
[12288]="7006B075\n1\tSpeak to Sâkhariz regarding the requested goods\tTravel to Kheb Hanût and speak to Sâkhariz there to gather reinforced bolts to secure the creature.\n2\tTravel to The Dûlkar and speak to Nadima\tTravel to The Dûlkar and speak to Nadima and retrieve apothecary supplies.\n3\tTalk to Rothog in Dâr Laja Meeting Hall\tReturn to Rothog and meet him in the Dâr Laja Meeting Hall.\n",
})
